## Triggers

| Trigger | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| `-init` | Initialize project context — onboard agent to new project |
| `-init path/to/docs` | Initialize from existing docs |
| `-init --existing` | Scan existing codebase, auto-build context |
| `-setup-be` | Scaffold FastAPI backend folder structure + first module |
| `-l` | Large task — full speckit workflow + agents |
| `-s` | Small task — plan files + implement |
| `-q` | Quick single change |
| `-us` | User story — full story + Mermaid diagrams |
| `-d` | Discussion / code explanation — read-only |
| `-fix` | Fix an error |
| `-test` | Write + run tests for existing code |
| `-review` | Code review — read-only |
| `-g direct` | Commit + push to current branch |
| `-g repo` | New branch + commit + push + open PR to dev |
| `-help` | Show all triggers with usage |

